  "query_preview": "..\n(Tuesday night through next Monday)\nIssued at 1236 PM CST Mon Nov 23 2026\n\nA cold moring is forecast across the area Wednesday morning due to \ngood radiation cooling conditions. Morning lows will be in the mid \nto upper 20s for most locations. A Freeze Warning was issued for all \nof West Central Texas from 11 PM Tuesday through 9 AM Wednesday. \nHighs on Wednesday will be in the mid 50s for most locations. \n\nThe cool weather is forecast to continue on Thanksgiving Day, with \nmorning lows in the upper 20s to lower 30s and high temperatures in \nthe 50s. A slow warm up is then forecast into next weekend. Highs on \nFriday will rebound into the low to mid 60s, with Saturday and \nSunday in the mid to upper 60s.",
